# Local dev server pids and logs (`make serve`).
.run/

# The screenshots implementation 04 was read from: twenty-five PNGs of three to
# five megabytes, 75 MB in all. They are evidence a person looked at once, they
# are on the machine that made them, and they would be four times the weight of
# everything else in this repository put together. The reports that cite them are
# committed; the pictures are not.
context/implementations/04-synthesia-to-notes/examples/

# Scratch: retired files and transfer archives. Never committed.
_to_delete/
**/_to_delete/

# poc-synthesia-frames: the research spike of implementation 04.
# The video and the frames sampled from it are a download and a cache, not
# source (V-01). The scripts, the calibrations, the ground truth and the
# pictures in out/ are kept; data/video/ is not.
poc-synthesia-frames/data/video/
poc-synthesia-frames/out/ui/
# The pictures in out/ are regenerated from the example screenshots, which are
# in the repository, by one command each — see the spike's README. Only the run
# log and the stitched roll are kept: the log is the evidence behind every
# number in RESULTS.md, and the stitched roll cannot be rebuilt without the
# video.
poc-synthesia-frames/out/thumbs/
poc-synthesia-frames/out/zoom/
poc-synthesia-frames/out/labels/
poc-synthesia-frames/out/calibration/
poc-synthesia-frames/out/detectors/
poc-synthesia-frames/scripts/__pycache__/
